WEBVTT

00:14.740 --> 00:15.830
<b>I feel uneasy.</b>

00:16.870 --> 00:18.870
<b>Boy, this place is huge.</b>

00:19.040 --> 00:22.920
<b><i>Ugh, what is this place?</i>
<i>It's so dark and damp.</i></b>

00:23.040 --> 00:24.420
<b><i>This place is definitely bad news.</i></b>

00:24.550 --> 00:27.970
<b><i>I already knew the</i>
<i>Monster Association's hideout was bad news</i></b>

00:28.130 --> 00:30.510
<b><i>but this is way creepier</i>
<i>than I imagined.</i></b>

00:30.550 --> 00:32.470
<b><i>Feels like a monster could attack</i>
<i>at any moment.</i></b>

00:32.510 --> 00:33.470
<b>Hey, King.</b>

00:33.510 --> 00:38.640
<b>RUMBLE RUMBLE</b>

00:34.470 --> 00:36.390
<b><i>Saitama, where are you?!</i></b>

00:36.560 --> 00:38.690
<b>- Are you listening to me, King?
- Huh?</b>

00:38.850 --> 00:40.850
<b>Even for someone who’s grown too strong</b>

00:40.900 --> 00:44.980
<b>does a dangerous place like this
still get your blood pumping?</b>

00:45.360 --> 00:47.030
<b>Too strong?</b>

00:47.150 --> 00:48.280
<b>I doubt that.</b>

00:48.280 --> 00:49.860
<b>There's always someone
stronger than you.</b>

00:49.900 --> 00:54.030
<b>Hmm...for the strongest man on Earth,
that’s a surprisingly dull thing to say.</b>

00:54.120 --> 00:57.790
<b>Hmph... Is it so selfish to
hope that might be true?</b>

00:57.950 --> 01:02.080
<b>As expected.
That's how a true warrior should be.</b>

01:02.330 --> 01:04.000
<b>I ought to learn from you.</b>

01:09.510 --> 01:11.760
<b>I DON'T CONSIDER MYSELF A HERO
TRAINING? NOT FOR ME (LOL)</b>

01:11.760 --> 01:13.890
<b>TRYING TO CHALLENGE ME?
WARNING: DON'T DO IT</b>

01:13.890 --> 01:15.890
<b>TOO STRONG? I DOUBT THAT</b>

01:16.470 --> 01:19.520
<b>Yeah... Well, I'm not lying...</b>

01:20.350 --> 01:22.900
<b>We should split up
into two groups from here.</b>

01:23.270 --> 01:24.560
<b>Right, King?</b>

01:24.650 --> 01:26.480
<b>Uh, um...yeah.</b>

01:30.780 --> 01:32.700
<b>Oh. These guys look like they live here.</b>

01:33.200 --> 01:34.120
<b>Hey...</b>

01:36.080 --> 01:40.910
<b>CRASH CRASH CRASH</b>

03:11.050 --> 03:14.970
<b>ULTIMATE LIFEFORM</b>

03:11.920 --> 03:13.720
<b>This chunk of meat...</b>

03:13.880 --> 03:15.090
<b>If we attacked it together</b>

03:14.970 --> 03:17.140
<b>CHOMP CHOMP
CRACK CRUNCH</b>

03:15.130 --> 03:17.090
<b>I thought he would be
a hearty meal for us...</b>

03:17.510 --> 03:20.010
<b>But he ate everybody!</b>

03:20.890 --> 03:21.810
<b>Yikes!</b>

03:22.220 --> 03:23.640
<b>What the heck are you?</b>

03:23.680 --> 03:24.680
<b>You're just a human...</b>

03:24.730 --> 03:27.770
<b>Stop! Don't eat me. Nooo!</b>

03:32.150 --> 03:34.240
<b>THREAT LEVEL: DRAGON
GUMS</b>

03:54.420 --> 03:56.880
<b>Why aren't you moving?</b>

03:57.130 --> 03:58.550
<b>Have you given up?</b>

03:59.890 --> 04:01.300
<b>What's going on?</b>

04:02.010 --> 04:05.930
<b>Superalloy Blackluster.
Why are you not fighting back?</b>

04:06.390 --> 04:07.730
<b>Insect God.</b>

04:08.230 --> 04:10.730
<b>When we first met,
you told me that...</b>

04:11.400 --> 04:15.240
<b>You're an invincible monster
that embodies the power of insects.</b>

04:15.900 --> 04:18.030
<b>That is exactly
what I've been striving for.</b>

04:18.400 --> 04:20.280
<b>The ultimate form of insect strength!</b>

04:21.530 --> 04:23.530
<b>Their tough exoskeletons and</b>

04:23.580 --> 04:26.830
<b>their perfectly efficient bodies
are impressive...</b>

04:27.500 --> 04:31.830
<b>But the real marvel is that
they're almost entirely made of muscle.</b>

04:32.380 --> 04:34.840
<b>And those muscles barely tire</b>

04:34.920 --> 04:37.630
<b>allowing them to stay active
for long periods.</b>

04:38.090 --> 04:40.800
<b>That is the perfection I aim for!</b>

04:41.470 --> 04:45.270
<b>I was deeply disappointed that a monster
attained it before I did.</b>

04:45.350 --> 04:47.730
<b>But at the same time,
I wanted to experience it for myself.</b>

04:47.810 --> 04:50.190
<b>The power worthy of being
called the Insect God...</b>

04:50.230 --> 04:53.150
<b>That speed...
that terrifying strength...</b>

04:54.230 --> 04:55.070
<b>But...</b>

04:55.190 --> 04:58.240
<b>You're far less impressive
than I expected.</b>

04:58.780 --> 05:00.990
<b>And for a so-called insect monster</b>

05:01.110 --> 05:02.530
<b>you lack the black sheen.</b>

05:02.910 --> 05:03.990
<b>What a letdown...</b>

05:04.080 --> 05:05.200
<b>What did you say?</b>

05:05.490 --> 05:08.580
<b>If you think you've grasped my true power
you're gravely mistaken—</b>

05:08.580 --> 05:10.670
<b>What a letdown!</b>

05:09.960 --> 05:10.830
<b>STARTLED</b>

05:11.330 --> 05:15.460
<b>This body is nothing more
than oversized muscle.</b>

05:15.750 --> 05:19.800
<b>But its performance surpasses yours,
Insect God.</b>

05:20.470 --> 05:22.340
<b>And let me warn you.</b>

05:22.720 --> 05:26.680
<b>There are three heroes
you must never anger.</b>

05:27.560 --> 05:29.770
<b>The strongest creature on Earth, King.</b>

05:30.310 --> 05:35.320
<b>RUMBLE RUMBLE</b>

05:30.310 --> 05:32.810
<b>If you make him angry,
the King Engine will roar</b>

05:32.810 --> 05:35.320
<b>and all evil will be wiped out.</b>

05:35.690 --> 05:39.030
<b>Then there's Tornado,
the psychic capable of untold slaughter!</b>

05:39.650 --> 05:42.950
<b>Tick her off, and she'll pulverize you
beyond recognition.</b>

05:43.530 --> 05:44.870
<b>Finally, there's me.</b>

05:44.990 --> 05:48.580
<b>Superalloy Blackluster,
always gleaming with a dark shine.</b>

05:48.870 --> 05:49.910
<b>Push me too far...</b>

05:49.910 --> 05:52.500
<b>and these muscles start
acting on their own.</b>

05:52.620 --> 05:53.580
<b>I see...</b>

05:53.790 --> 05:56.960
<b>You want to know what happens
if you anger me?</b>

05:57.460 --> 06:00.630
<b>Even the fists of Garou,
the Hero Hunter</b>

06:00.720 --> 06:04.470
<b>who you've all been struggling
to defeat, had no effect on me.</b>

06:04.800 --> 06:07.720
<b>My outer shell is
an impenetrable armor.</b>

06:08.260 --> 06:12.690
<b>The explosive power
of insect muscles is</b>

06:12.730 --> 06:16.190
<b>on a whole different level
from you mammals.</b>

06:16.860 --> 06:19.820
<b>In other words,
my whole body is a weapon.</b>

06:20.110 --> 06:21.900
<b>I'm going to shred
those fake muscles</b>

06:22.030 --> 06:24.860
<b>and feed them to the bugs.</b>

06:25.370 --> 06:26.990
<b>That's reckless.</b>

06:34.620 --> 06:37.000
<b>I'll smash you to bits!!</b>

06:38.750 --> 06:41.010
<b>I told you, that's reckless.</b>

06:41.300 --> 06:46.180
<b>Even I don't know how to
inflict a wound on this body.</b>

06:46.720 --> 06:47.550
<b>Hmm.</b>

06:47.800 --> 06:52.680
<b>Unless it's a top-tier monster,
my muscles don't get fired up.</b>

06:53.640 --> 06:56.230
<b>Whoa. The ground is shaking hard.</b>

06:56.310 --> 06:58.520
<b>Is someone fighting
one of the big shots?</b>

07:04.530 --> 07:06.950
<b>Wow! That's a huge dog!</b>

07:10.030 --> 07:10.870
<b>Oh, I know!</b>

07:13.000 --> 07:14.870
<b>Here you go, doggy.</b>

07:15.000 --> 07:16.080
<b>I'll give you this bone</b>

07:16.330 --> 07:20.920
<b>so take me to the big monster
that's making all this noise.</b>

07:21.250 --> 07:23.800
<b>There, there. Good doggy.</b>

07:27.510 --> 07:28.890
<b>Firing at me without warning?</b>

07:28.890 --> 07:30.470
<b>You need to be taught some discipline.</b>

07:33.720 --> 07:35.940
<b>So you're one of the monsters
making all this noise?</b>

07:38.600 --> 07:39.440
<b>Sit.</b>

08:16.930 --> 08:20.350
<b>Assault team, are you okay?
Respond! What happened?</b>

08:20.810 --> 08:22.440
<b>Damn it. I can't tell what's going on.</b>

08:25.650 --> 08:28.030
<b>Earthquake...?
No, a shock wave...?</b>

08:28.780 --> 08:30.950
<b>No high-energy reactions
detected in the vicinity...</b>

08:31.490 --> 08:33.530
<b>A shockwave from outside
the detection range.</b>

08:33.780 --> 08:35.240
<b>Its power is off the charts.</b>

08:36.000 --> 08:38.250
<b>Which means...
that just now was possibly...</b>

08:39.420 --> 08:42.000
<b><i>Knowing how steadfast</i>
<i>Master Saitama is</i></b>

08:42.080 --> 08:44.840
<b><i>I wouldn't be surprised if</i>
<i>he's already on his way to the hideout.</i></b>

08:46.670 --> 08:49.720
<b><i>No way... He took down Pochi</i>
<i>with just one punch...?</i></b>

08:50.090 --> 08:51.890
<b><i>He still hasn't noticed me.</i></b>

08:52.050 --> 08:54.220
<b><i>This is my chance</i>
<i>to catch him off guard.</i></b>

08:55.520 --> 08:57.480
<b>Intense Catstigation!</b>

08:57.810 --> 08:58.640
<b>Hm?</b>

09:01.900 --> 09:03.520
<b>First a dog, now a cat?</b>

09:03.610 --> 09:05.320
<b><i>My claws! They didn't work!</i></b>

09:05.650 --> 09:07.650
<b><i>This guy is bad news.</i></b>

09:07.780 --> 09:11.030
<b><i>There's no reason to risk my life</i>
<i>for the Monster Association.</i></b>

09:11.490 --> 09:12.570
<b><i>I'm outta here, meow!!</i></b>

09:13.070 --> 09:16.410
<b>Huh? What's his deal?</b>

09:17.290 --> 09:19.540
<b>Oh well, whatever.
Guess I'll get going.</b>

09:20.290 --> 09:22.000
<b><i>That was loud.</i></b>

09:22.500 --> 09:26.000
<b><i>Sounds like Pochi's gone</i>
<i>quiet up there.</i></b>

09:27.590 --> 09:28.760
<b><i>Don't tell me...</i></b>

09:29.130 --> 09:30.800
<b>Getting worried?</b>

09:30.930 --> 09:33.430
<b>Maybe one of your top monsters
got taken out.</b>

09:35.260 --> 09:37.520
<b>So...are you the boss?</b>

09:37.890 --> 09:42.060
<b>Well, well... I'm delighted
you've come all the way here.</b>

09:42.520 --> 09:45.190
<b>Welcome to our hideout, Hero...</b>

09:54.740 --> 09:59.410
<b>I figured you were the one
I'd have to deal with personally...</b>

10:00.580 --> 10:05.040
<b>Terrible Tornado.
The prodigy of supernatural powers.</b>

10:06.920 --> 10:08.750
<b>My name is Gyoro-Gyoro.</b>

10:09.050 --> 10:11.170
<b>I am the strategist of
the Monster Association.</b>

10:11.380 --> 10:15.640
<b>And the creator of the new world
ruled by monsters.</b>

10:15.800 --> 10:19.390
<b>So basically,
you're the boss here, right?</b>

10:19.890 --> 10:20.770
<b>Die.</b>

10:55.720 --> 10:57.140
<b>Is that all you got?</b>

11:06.020 --> 11:08.060
<b>She broke through my barrier?!</b>

11:08.270 --> 11:11.190
<b>Damn it... This could get ugly.</b>

11:11.780 --> 11:15.240
<b>Very well. I won't hold back either.</b>

11:15.490 --> 11:17.740
<b>I'll fight you in my true form!</b>

11:20.280 --> 11:24.460
<b>Tornado! Is this your first time facing
a psychic superior than yourself?</b>

11:24.790 --> 11:26.540
<b>Well, have fun.</b>

11:26.790 --> 11:28.880
<b>Super Raging Waves of Gravity.</b>

11:31.170 --> 11:32.840
<b>300 times gravity!</b>

11:33.300 --> 11:35.840
<b>I'll flatten you like a pancake.</b>

11:37.390 --> 11:39.010
<b>Not bad for a high ranker.</b>

11:39.140 --> 11:40.390
<b>Feels pretty good.</b>

11:40.640 --> 11:43.180
<b>But can you apply more pressure
on my right shoulder?</b>

11:43.560 --> 11:46.310
<b>I recently changed my pillow
and my shoulder's stiff.</b>

11:46.480 --> 11:49.230
<b>Why you...!!</b>

11:55.990 --> 11:58.860
<b>Huh? Oh...huh?</b>

11:58.990 --> 11:59.950
<b>Whoa, wait.</b>

12:04.750 --> 12:07.750
<b><i>Damn woman!</i></b>

12:07.870 --> 12:11.540
<b><i>She's much more powerful</i>
<i>than I expected.</i></b>

12:12.040 --> 12:14.420
<b>She’s leagues above
her younger sister...!</b>

12:14.630 --> 12:16.510
<b>Alright, I get it. You're powerful.</b>

12:16.630 --> 12:20.260
<b>But you didn't have to kill me
so gruesomely.</b>

12:20.640 --> 12:23.810
<b>You're so cruel, Terrible Tornado.</b>

12:24.220 --> 12:26.770
<b>You're just a lump of meat
that feels no pain.</b>

12:26.770 --> 12:28.440
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

12:28.980 --> 12:30.810
<b>Now I'm going to draw out
your true form.</b>

12:31.190 --> 12:34.150
<b><i>Oh no, she saw right through me.</i></b>

12:34.610 --> 12:37.950
<b><i>I wasn't ready...to challenge her...</i></b>

12:38.360 --> 12:41.370
<b><i>In that case...</i>
<i>there is only one option left.</i></b>

12:41.950 --> 12:46.370
<b>Lord Orochi! Please help me.</b>

12:46.500 --> 12:50.960
<b>Please take this woman down!
Lord Orochi!</b>

12:51.080 --> 12:56.210
<b>Orochi? Oh yeah,
someone did mention that name.</b>

12:56.420 --> 13:01.430
<b>I may be the commander,
but our boss is Monster King Orochi.</b>

13:01.550 --> 13:03.430
<b>Even as the one who
created this true monster</b>

13:03.430 --> 13:06.180
<b>I can’t fathom the limits
of his boundless power.</b>

13:07.640 --> 13:11.150
<b>It's over for you, Tornado.</b>

13:12.900 --> 13:13.770
<b>Hmm?</b>

13:13.810 --> 13:15.730
<b>Huh...? No one's coming.</b>

13:16.320 --> 13:18.110
<b><i>Why? That's strange.</i></b>

13:18.490 --> 13:23.570
<b><i>I've brainwashed him to</i>
<i>never defy my orders.</i></b>

13:23.780 --> 13:26.620
<b>Maybe he's too busy
to come save you.</b>

13:27.120 --> 13:30.290
<b>Maybe he's facing off with
some other hero right now.</b>

13:30.710 --> 13:32.250
<b>They're no match for me</b>

13:32.370 --> 13:34.290
<b>but I hear the others
are pretty strong too.</b>

13:34.420 --> 13:35.710
<b>W-Wait. Wait just a minute.</b>

13:36.000 --> 13:39.670
<b>Let's calm down and
talk this over. Okay?</b>

13:44.180 --> 13:48.270
<b><i>There's an opponent so powerful</i>
<i>he would ignore my plight?</i></b>

13:49.020 --> 13:51.350
<b><i>No, that can't be.</i>
<i>I'm up against Tornado here!</i></b>

13:51.890 --> 13:53.600
<b><i>Hurry up and get over here.</i></b>

13:54.100 --> 13:55.650
<b><i>Where did he go?</i></b>

14:10.500 --> 14:13.670
<b>First, a couple of naked guys,
then a dog and a cat.</b>

14:13.830 --> 14:15.580
<b>I was wondering what's coming next...</b>

14:16.340 --> 14:18.590
<b>And now,
something utterly absurd shows up.</b>

14:26.010 --> 14:28.310
<b>I live right above here.</b>

14:28.510 --> 14:31.270
<b>I heard some noise, so I went out
for a walk to check it out.</b>

14:32.890 --> 14:35.020
<b>That shockwave from earlier...</b>

14:35.730 --> 14:38.360
<b>It was out of the ordinary,
so I came to see for myself.</b>

14:39.190 --> 14:41.440
<b>It wasn't even on the watch list.</b>

14:41.900 --> 14:46.320
<b>An unforeseen, formidable presence
that could pose a real threat to us...</b>

14:47.030 --> 14:49.790
<b>It must be destroyed now
or it could be dangerous.</b>

14:51.080 --> 14:54.250
<b>We? So that means
you guys living here</b>

14:54.250 --> 14:56.000
<b>are all in the same group
or something?</b>

14:56.250 --> 14:59.040
<b>You're out here talking about
threats and danger, but...</b>

14:59.800 --> 15:02.050
<b>I'm the one being attacked here.</b>

15:02.460 --> 15:03.800
<b>I'm just fighting back.</b>

15:10.100 --> 15:11.930
<b>So you're going to attack me, huh?</b>

15:14.480 --> 15:18.480
<b>You're alive, Pochi?
Kill this human.</b>

15:20.070 --> 15:21.400
<b>Dang it, I got burnt!</b>

15:32.240 --> 15:34.040
<b>What did you do to Pochi?</b>

15:34.580 --> 15:35.540
<b>I punched it.</b>

15:36.040 --> 15:38.170
<b>How dare you burn my cape.</b>

15:41.500 --> 15:43.800
<b>You're definitely a monster.</b>

15:43.960 --> 15:46.300
<b>So I'm not holding back.
You're gonna get a normal punch.</b>

15:46.680 --> 15:48.340
<b><i>He held back against Pochi...?</i></b>

15:48.680 --> 15:50.640
<b><i>No, that wasn't a bluff.</i></b>

15:51.140 --> 15:54.640
<b><i>The monster cells within me</i>
<i>are roaring.</i></b>

15:55.350 --> 15:58.020
<b><i>I see now. So it was him.</i></b>

15:58.020 --> 16:00.610
<b><i>That inexplicable presence I sensed...</i></b>

16:01.320 --> 16:04.360
<b><i>Goketsu...Centichoro...</i></b>

16:04.990 --> 16:08.780
<b><i>The beast rumored to live</i>
<i>in the ghost town above.</i></b>

16:09.410 --> 16:12.990
<b><i>Neither the Monster Association</i>
<i>nor I were responsible.</i></b>

16:13.120 --> 16:14.330
<b><i>It was this man!</i></b>

16:16.790 --> 16:20.330
<b><i>I haven't been this excited</i>
<i>in a long time.</i></b>

16:22.290 --> 16:25.760
<b><i>Every monster cell</i>
<i>within me senses it.</i></b>

16:25.880 --> 16:30.300
<b><i>This man is the perfect sacrifice</i>
<i>for my resurrection.</i></b>

16:33.640 --> 16:36.850
<b>Looks like this will be
the final showdown.</b>

16:40.230 --> 16:42.480
<b>I'm interested in you.</b>

16:42.860 --> 16:46.900
<b>The peak of biological strength
a human can attain.</b>

16:47.030 --> 16:50.110
<b>How far can it hold up against me?</b>

16:50.610 --> 16:52.910
<b>I'm looking forward to this.</b>

16:54.120 --> 16:58.580
<b>Can you awaken my ego and
emotions that were shrouded in a haze?</b>

16:59.830 --> 17:04.170
<b>Through countless sacrifices,
I have become the ultimate lifeform.</b>

17:05.170 --> 17:06.340
<b>Under Gyoro-Gyoro</b>

17:06.340 --> 17:11.680
<b>I endured endless fusion and combat
experiments with the strongest warriors.</b>

17:11.970 --> 17:15.260
<b>I evolved from a human
into an extraordinary monster...</b>

17:15.260 --> 17:16.680
<b>The ultimate being.</b>

17:18.850 --> 17:23.400
<b>Fate led you here as my sacrifice.</b>

17:23.650 --> 17:27.070
<b>Come, fight me like
it's a combat experiment</b>

17:27.070 --> 17:29.030
<b>and offer your body to me.</b>

17:29.700 --> 17:33.240
<b>For I am a god whose rebirth
was foretold in ancient times</b>

17:33.240 --> 17:36.160
<b>and destined to
descend upon this world...</b>

17:36.370 --> 17:37.950
<b>-I am Oroch—
-Hey, that's enough.</b>

17:38.120 --> 17:40.250
<b>I'm not interested in you at all.</b>

17:40.660 --> 17:43.040
<b>Don't get all worked up by yourself...</b>

17:43.460 --> 17:46.460
<b>I'm sick of hearing introductions
like that. No offense.</b>

17:47.130 --> 17:49.840
<b>King of so-and-so...
Ancient weapon so-and-so...</b>

17:49.880 --> 17:53.220
<b>Final evolution so-and-so...
So-and-so of the entire universe...</b>

17:53.340 --> 17:54.850
<b>Blah blah blah.</b>

17:55.760 --> 17:58.560
<b>I've dealt with plenty like you before.</b>

17:59.020 --> 18:00.600
<b>So what makes you different
from them?</b>

18:01.640 --> 18:03.600
<b>Even if you call yourself
the ultimate being...</b>

18:03.730 --> 18:05.440
<b>You're still going down
in one punch anyway.</b>

18:07.230 --> 18:08.820
<b>Guess you were just bored.</b>

18:09.780 --> 18:11.820
<b>You got stronger</b>

18:11.820 --> 18:14.200
<b>but you got that confused
with reaching your goal.</b>

18:15.200 --> 18:18.080
<b>Bring it on.
But I'm not expecting much.</b>

18:18.370 --> 18:21.540
<b>I am destined to become a god!</b>

18:44.020 --> 18:47.900
<b>So in a monster hideout,
lightning can come up from underground?</b>

18:48.020 --> 18:49.860
<b>ZAP</b>

19:37.660 --> 19:39.780
<b>What...did you just...do...?</b>

19:40.530 --> 19:42.540
<b>Huh...? Just a normal punch.</b>

19:43.620 --> 19:44.580
<b><i>So this is...</i></b>

19:45.330 --> 19:46.460
<b><i>...fear.</i></b>

21:45.030 --> 21:46.830
<b>RUMBLE RUMBLE</b>

21:47.120 --> 21:49.080
<b>Split up into two groups, huh?</b>

21:49.660 --> 21:52.040
<b>In that case,
I'll follow your lead, Silverfang.</b>

21:52.580 --> 21:55.670
<b>All right,
then you can go that way.</b>

21:56.000 --> 21:56.840
<b><i>What?</i></b>

21:57.170 --> 21:59.260
<b>That means we'll go this way.</b>

21:59.420 --> 22:01.170
<b>Uh-huh.. Then let's go.</b>

22:01.430 --> 22:04.470
<b><i>That's not what I meant</i>
<i>by "follow your lead."</i></b>

22:01.430 --> 22:08.430
<b>RUMBLE RUMBLE</b>

22:05.350 --> 22:08.470
<b><i>Normally, four people should be split up</i>
<i>into two groups of two.</i></b>

22:08.600 --> 22:09.680
<b><i>That's just common sense.</i></b>

22:10.020 --> 22:12.190
<b><i>Why do I have to end up alone?</i></b>

22:13.400 --> 22:15.020
<b><i>Oh well. I'll just deal with it.</i></b>

22:15.610 --> 22:18.320
<b><i>Until the strong heroes</i>
<i>wipe out the enemy</i></b>

22:18.320 --> 22:20.360
<b><i>I'll hide my presence and</i>
<i>stay out of sight.</i></b>

22:20.990 --> 22:21.900
<b>Phew...</b>

22:21.990 --> 22:23.990
<b><i>I'll imagine that I'm a cloud.</i></b>

22:24.240 --> 22:27.330
<b><i>No, that sounds too grand.</i>
<i>I can't relate to that.</i></b>

22:27.580 --> 22:29.870
<b><i>I can be a</i>
<i>motionless microorganism that is</i></b>

22:29.870 --> 22:31.540
<b><i>unseen, unnoticed,</i>
<i>and bothering no one.</i></b>

22:31.710 --> 22:33.210
<b><i>That doesn't feel right either.</i></b>

22:33.540 --> 22:35.170
<b><i>I'm a being that is close</i>
<i>to nothingness</i></b>

22:35.170 --> 22:37.040
<b><i>and I just float around.</i></b>

22:37.170 --> 22:38.000
<b>King?</b>

22:39.250 --> 22:40.130
<b>Huh!?</b>

22:41.720 --> 22:44.590
<b><i>That hostage kid...?!</i>
<i>Why is he in front of me?</i></b>

22:45.760 --> 22:47.050
<b>I was so scared!</b>

22:47.180 --> 22:49.310
<b>I've been running away
all alone this whole time.</b>

22:49.350 --> 22:52.180
<b>There's a monster coming
after me from that way.</b>

22:52.430 --> 22:54.390
<b>But now that King is here,
I'm safe, right?</b>

22:54.560 --> 22:55.650
<b>Can you protect me?</b>

22:55.900 --> 22:58.570
<b>Carry me on your back
and take me to the exit!</b>

22:59.190 --> 23:02.240
<b>No. Well, um...that's...uh...</b>

23:03.400 --> 23:10.410
<b>RUMBLE RUMBLE</b>

23:04.280 --> 23:05.780
<b><i>That sound. Is that the King Engine?</i></b>

23:06.110 --> 23:08.450
<b>Um...You don't want me.</b>

23:08.950 --> 23:12.410
<b>It would be wiser to find
a different hero.</b>

23:12.500 --> 23:19.500
<b>RUMBLE RUMBLE</b>

23:12.830 --> 23:15.790
<b>Even if you rely on me,
I can't be of any help.</b>

23:16.250 --> 23:19.540
<b>If I try to help you, you'll only end up
being disappointed.</b>

23:19.800 --> 23:21.420
<b><i>He already saw through me?</i></b>

23:21.670 --> 23:23.720
<b><i>But my disguise was perfect.</i></b>

23:23.920 --> 23:28.720
<b>RUMBLE RUMBLE</b>

23:24.170 --> 23:25.550
<b><i>Oh no. I'm screwed.</i></b>

23:25.680 --> 23:27.180
<b><i>I'm so scared. Crap.</i></b>

23:27.340 --> 23:28.800
<b><i>My transformation is falling apart.</i></b>

23:34.680 --> 23:36.230
<b><i>Huh? What happened?</i></b>

23:34.680 --> 23:39.610
<b>RUMBLE RUMBLE</b>

23:36.270 --> 23:39.610
<b><i>I'm scared. Help me, Saitama.</i></b>

23:46.280 --> 23:47.410
<b>Told you so.</b>

23:47.410 --> 23:49.450
<b>I ended it with just one punch again.</b>
